**Goal:** Extend PR #963's typed summary-error classification (Claude-only) to the other four summary-capable providers (Codex, Gemini CLI, Cursor, Copilot CLI) through a shared `*agent.TextGenError` + `Classifier` engine with declarative per-agent phrase tables.

